## 🔐 인증

### 인증 방식

[JWT / OAuth 2.0 / API Key / etc.]

### 헤더

```http
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json
```

### 토큰 획득

```http
POST /auth/login
```

**Request**:
```json
{
  "username": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
  "expires_in": 3600
}
```

